{"ticker":"TLN","updated":"2026-11-27T23:25:26Z","profile":{"longName":"Talen Energy Corporation","shortName":"Talen Energy Corporation","sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Independent Power Producers","country":"United States","website":"https://www.talenenergy.com","fullTimeEmployees":1880,"marketCap":15646251008,"trailingPE":null,"forwardPE":11.175886,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.4916873,"pegRatio":null,"targetMeanPrice":452.65,"targetHighPrice":560.0,"targetLowPrice":307.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":20,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.961,"earningsGrowth":-0.322,"grossMargins":0.42668998,"operatingMargins":0.03325,"profitMargins":-0.05668,"totalRevenue":4480999936,"beta":1.579,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":449.841,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":279.77,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Talen Energy Corporation, an independent power producer and infrastructure company, produces and sells electricity, capacity, and ancillary services into wholesale power markets in the United States. The company's plants generate power using a variety of fuels, such as nuclear, fossil, oil, natural gas, and coal power plants. It owns and operates approximately 13.1 GW of power infrastructure. Talen Energy Corporation was incorporated in 2014 and is headquartered in Houston, Texas.","summary_zh":"Talen Energy Corporation 是一家獨立電力生產商和基礎設施公司，生產並向美國批發電力市場銷售電力、容量和輔助服務。該公司的工廠使用各種燃料發電，例如核電廠、化石燃料電廠、石油電廠、天然氣電廠和燃煤電廠。它擁有並運營約13.1吉瓦的電力基礎設施。 Talen Energy Corporation 成立於 2014 年，總部位於德克薩斯州休斯頓。","sector_zh":"公用事業","industry_zh":"公用事業 - 獨立電力生產商","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-29","o":414.0,"h":424.98,"l":404.57,"c":420.7,"v":702000},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":420.87,"h":428.94,"l":418.746,"c":425.38,"v":653400},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":423.33,"h":437.06,"l":421.14,"c":426.99,"v":780600},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":429.9,"h":434.98,"l":421.708,"c":434.07,"v":661400},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":437.93,"h":451.28,"l":431.14,"c":438.5,"v":916100},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":448.